If you're in the mines and you're hungry, you're not eating
enough corpses.  Very likely you're carrying so much stuff
that you can't easily pick up the many corpses you encounter.

While in the mines, kill the smallest number you can, pick
up one or more fresh corpses, retreat to a comparatively
safe location, and eat.  Do this until Satisfied.  Follow
this strategy as opposed to killing everything as fast as
possible.  Killing too fast wastes corpses.  Only waste
corpses while Satisfied.

> Is there any good strategy to deal with this?

Others have mentioned praying when you hit Weak.  With the
kill-1-and-retreat strategy that often isn't needed.

By the time I get to minetown I am generally beginning to
develop a stash that includes food.

> Can you stand in one place and wait for monsters to come
> to you without getting hungry as quickly?

No.


